1️⃣ Step 1 — Node.js Install

✅
node -v
npm -v

2️⃣ Step 2 — Project mein package.json banayein

✅
npm init -y

3️⃣ Step 3 — PurgeCSS CLI Install Karen

✅
npm install -D purgecss

4️⃣ Step 4 — Config File Banayein
Root mein purgecss.config.cjs naam ki file banayein:

✅
// purgecss.config.cjs
module.exports = {
  // these files will be scanned for used CSS classes
  content: [
    "./index.php",
    "./assets/js/custom.js"
    //'./assets/js/**/*.js',  // custom.js and other js files in assets/js/ folder
    // if we have multiple .php, .html files add here:
    // "./**/*.php",
    // "./**/*.html",
  ],

  // this css will be processed by PurgeCSS to remove unused classes from it
  css: ["./assets/css/custom.css"],

  // Output folder
  output: "./assets/css/",

  // Bootstrap aur JS se dynamically add hone wali classes ko bachana
  safelist: {
    standard: [
      /^carousel/,    // Bootstrap carousel classes
      /^swiper/,      // Agar swiper slider use hai
      /^slick/,       // Agar slick slider use hai
      /^modal/,       // Bootstrap modals
      /^dropdown/,    // Bootstrap dropdowns
      /^collapse/,    // Bootstrap collapse
      /^collapsing$/,
      /^tooltip/,
      /^popover/,
      /^offcanvas/,
      /^show$/,
      /^fade$/,
      /^active$/,
      /^disabled$/,
      /^open$/,
    ],
    deep: [
      /^data-/,
    ]
  }
};

5️⃣ Step 5 — package.json mein Script Add Karen
package.json mein scripts section mein yeh add karen:

✅
"scripts": {
"purge": "purgecss --css assets/css/custom.css assets/fontawesome/css/all.min.css assets/css/bootstrap.min.css --content index.php assets/js/custom.js --output assets/css/"
if using purge.mjs
"purge": "node purge.mjs"
}

6️⃣ Step 6 — Run Karen

✅
npm run purge